      "content": "i know, i know, you're right about the side effects. but honestly, it's so painful i'm desperate. i've taken double doses before when i was really bad and it seemed to work fine. plus, the pain is so sudden and intense, it feels much more like my usual migraine aura than anything else. if i just take the extra pill now, i can probably just sleep it off and be fine by morning, right? i just really, really don't want to spend my whole night in the er waiting for nothing.",
